### Salud del servicio (sin autenticacion)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Documentacion interactiva
GET http://localhost:3000/api/docs

### Iniciar sesion como administrador
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Iniciar sesion como cajero
# @name loginCashier
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cajero",
  "password": "Cajero123"
}

### Datos del usuario de la sesion
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar sucursales
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/branches?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar solo sucursales activas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/branches?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear una sucursal (solo ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NORTE",
  "name": "Sucursal Norte",
  "address": "Calle Morelos 45",
  "phone": "5551234568"
}

### La misma creacion con un cajero debe responder 403
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUR",
  "name": "No deberia crearse"
}

### Peticion sin token: debe responder 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Cambiar la contraseña
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin123",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClave123",
  "confirmPassword": "NuevaClave123"
}
